Mint.

&nbsp;

Possibly one of the wildest games I&#39;ve played. There&#39;s a lot going on!

&nbsp;

As others have said, it starts out looking bad, but gets better once the presents start being opened.

&nbsp;

Somewhere in the midst of opening Aregent Adept&#39;s 7 presents, I lost track of things and forgot whose turn it was, who had used what power on this turn,&nbsp;where I was in the&nbsp;many nesting dolls of Arcane Cadences and Silver Shadows....I just kept hitting &quot;choose for me&quot; and hoped for the best.  :wink: 

&nbsp;

After all of the chaos, the army of bots chomped La Capitan down to 0HP. All heroes were right around 20HP.

